To set the reliability to 99.999% for a real-time video analytics URLLC (Ultra-Reliable Low Latency Communications) slice in Europe-West, you can use the following command in the TNS (Terraform Network Service) provider:
```hcl
resource "tencentcloud_tns_slice" "example" {
  // ... other properties ...
  reliability = 99.999
  region      = "Europe"
  zone        = "Europe-West"
  // ... other properties ...
}
```
This sets the reliability to 99.999% for the URLLC slice in the specified region and zone.
